      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1. No contract or proposal for work to be performed chargeable to this budget, except for work to be performed for the Board of Education, the cost of which is estimated to be in excess of $20,000, shall be advertised until such contract and specifications or proposal shall have been submitted to and approved by the Director of the Office of Management and Budget. No contract or proposal for work to be performed chargeable to this budget, for the Board of Education, the cost of which is estimated to be in excess of $50,000, shall be advertised until such contract and specifications or proposal shall have been submitted to and approved by the Director of the Office of Management and Budget.",
